# Rootstock (RSK) Integration Rules

## Overview

Rootstock (RSK) is a Bitcoin sidechain that brings smart contract functionality to Bitcoin. It enables Bitcoin holders to participate in DeFi and smart contracts while maintaining Bitcoin's security through merge-mining.

### Key Features

- Bitcoin merge-mining security
- EVM-compatible smart contracts  
- Native Bitcoin (RBTC) support
- RIF token ecosystem
- Gas fees paid in RBTC
- 2-way peg with Bitcoin

